{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsHunter-8535": "HUNTER: 到岔路口可得留神，右边那条路通往一个地方，蛮族管那里叫“龙池”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsHunter-8536": "HUNTER: 老兄，那名字可一点都没夸张。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsHunter2-8537": "HUNTER: 我们往龙池那条路上探了一眼，立刻就回头了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMailman-8538": "MAILMAN: 想搭船回河流交汇处吗？不过受这股水流影响，我可没法再把你们送回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMailman-8539": "不了",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMailman-8540": "好",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsAssitant-8541": "ASSISTANT: 你问我们怎么收报酬？当地蛮族会拿兽皮抵账，有时也由我们付钱，雇他们来做守卫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsAssitant-8542": "ASSISTANT: 至于那些小动物，一般会拿溪流里找到的金块或小宝石来换东西，有时也会告诉我们哪里有可以回收的旧物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsAssitant-8543": "ASSISTANT: 尤鲁兽通常用松露付款。论闻着味儿找松露，谁都比不过它们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsGuard1-8544": "BARBARIAN: 我母亲说，她的城里话是跟一头友善的尤鲁兽学的。是一位名叫奎罗的年长雌兽。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsGuard2-8545": "BARBARIAN: 好久没见过尤鲁兽了，我小时候这一带可多得很呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8546": "HUNTER: 各位好啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8547": "HUNTER: 你们飞来的那条船可真气派，有没有小一点、便宜一点的款式？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8548": "NIKOLAI: 你看到飞空艇了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8549": "HUNTER: 那么大个东西从天边过，想不看见都难。正巧我躲在猎鸭棚里，抬头望天呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8550": "HUNTER: 跟你们一起的，是头尤鲁兽？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8551": "HUNTER: 幸会，女士。有阵子没见到你们一族了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8552": "JUNA: 你常在这一带打猎？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8553": "HUNTER: 没以前那么勤了。河东北边的野兽变得……唉，你比谁都清楚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8554": "JUNA: 没有我们族群的消息吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8555": "HUNTER: 嗯……也许有，不过旱季的时候，尤鲁兽和诺托兽的足迹不太好分。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8556": "HUNTER: 不过，我确实看到了大群动物留下的足迹，通向这里东北边的会面地点。诺托兽一般不会成这么大的群。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8557": "JUNA: 能顺着这条线索去看看吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8558": "JUNA: 会面地点很偏僻，附近恐怕没地方能让飞空艇安全降落，我们得走过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8559": "ALEXANDRA: 会面地点？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8560": "HUNTER: 部族和商人会在那里跟动物们碰头，做买卖、收信。不过，要过去还得走上好一段路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8561": "ALEXANDRA: ……收信？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8562": "JUNA: 对啊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-hunterGreeting-8563": "BEN: 这我可得见识见识。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8564": "JUNA: 就是这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8565": "JUNA: 比以前冷清多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8566": "BIRD: 咿——。咿，咿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8567": "MAILMAN: 她说什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8568": "ASSISTANT: 肯定提到了风之门。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8569": "BIRD: 咿！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8570": "BIRD: 咿——咿咿，咿——咿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8571": "ASSISTANT: 还有……她的亲戚？抱歉，太平鸟不太会用魔法模拟人声。我记得它们平常会自带翻译。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8572": "MAILMAN: 我想我懂了，你的亲戚会在门的另一边接我们，再付送货的钱，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8573": "BIRD: 咿！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8574": "MAILMAN: 那好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8575": "MAILMAN: 你好，你是因杜詹那一群的吗？我这儿有他的邮件。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8576": "ASSISTANT: 族群的其他成员呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8577": "JUNA: 我是独自来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8578": "JUNA: 倒也不是独自，只是没有别的尤鲁兽。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8579": "JUNA: 有我的同族来过吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8580": "GUARD: 这个季节没有。不过我一个族人去年冬天见过一些，趁河面结冰时过河去了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8581": "JUNA: 我已经有多久没见过同族了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8582": "ALEXANDRA: 可他们还在啊，刚才那个人不是说，有人见过他们吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8583": "ASSISTANT: 现在他们迁移得比以前快，也更频繁了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8584": "ASSISTANT: 主要是为了躲避御风猎手，还有那些获得了魔法的诺托兽。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8585": "ASSISTANT: 听说他们现在都到森林或山洞里过夜，连草场都要一周换两次。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8586": "JUNA: 这么做是很聪明。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8587": "JUNA: 可他们这样不停地换地方，叫我上哪儿找去！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8588": "ALEXANDRA: 嘿，我们有飞空艇啊！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8589": "ALEXANDRA: 等打倒那个独裁者，我就开着飞空艇，带大家多找找。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8590": "JUNA: 那我可记着了，不许反悔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8591": "ALEXANDRA: 好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8592": "MAILMAN: 哦，还真有样东西能给你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8593": "MAILMAN: 这是寄给尤鲁兽的包裹，可收件人的名字看不清，我都背烦了，你拿去吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsMeetingSite-8594": "MAILMAN: 真遇上收件人，你们俩自己解决。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsExit-8595": "MAILMAN: 那就上船吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsAssistant-8596": "ASSISTANT: 你问我们怎么收报酬？蛮族会拿黄金或兽皮抵账，有时也由我们付钱，雇他们当守卫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsAssistant-8597": "ASSISTANT: 至于那些小动物，一般会拿溪流里找到的金块或小宝石来换东西，有时也会告诉我们哪里有可以回收的旧物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-wildsAssistant-8598": "ASSISTANT: 尤鲁兽通常用松露付款。论闻着味儿找松露，谁都比不过它们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/junaSidequest.yarn-dinoWarning-8599": "HUNTER: 嘿，小心点，你们一走动，怪物就能听见！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-returnToAirship-7600": "返回飞空艇？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-returnToAirship-7601": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-returnToAirship-7602": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Nikolai-7603": "NIKOLAI: 敌人既狡猾又强大，我们得做好万全准备。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Nikolai-7604": "NIKOLAI: 军队要是在撤退，我的家乡就离前线很近了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Juna-7605": "JUNA: 等这一切结束，就能去找我的族群了，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Juna-7606": "JUNA: 那我可记着了，不许反悔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Juna-7607": "JUNA: 不知道有没有族群回到东北荒野了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Juna-7608": "JUNA: 不管怎样，我都想弄清楚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Zikaron-7609": "ZIKARON: ……山……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Ben-7610": "BEN: 房租都欠了快两年了，恐怕得回阿科斯看看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Ben-7611": "BEN: 房租不是问题了，可我还是想知道，卡茜后来怎么样了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Ben-7612": "BEN: 我挺高兴的……能弄清那些事，总归比不知道好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Cordelia-7613": "CORDELIA: 能再见到奥克塔维娅，真让人高兴。不过，她实在该搬到一个更……文明的地方去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Cordelia-7614": "CORDELIA: 别再耽搁了，该去救科诺弗一家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Cordelia-7615": "CORDELIA: 最后的任务之前，理应做好充分的装备准备，也该了结那些尚未了结的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Cordelia-7616": "CORDELIA: 首都那边，还有不少信件等着我去取。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Jerome-7617": "JEROME: 这趟旅程要是再离奇下去，我可不知道自己能不能承受……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Jerome-7618": "JEROME: 传单上说，可以去洛蕾恩的威格拉姆宅邸打听，就在东南方、海峡对岸，乘飞空艇过去很快。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Jerome-7619": "JEROME: 那只猫说，该找个能望见尼巴罗斯山的村子，采集一只月光蝶。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Jerome-7620": "JEROME: 把蝴蝶带回威格拉姆宅邸吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Jerome-7621": "JEROME: 不清楚威格拉姆宅邸发生了什么，但他们一定需要我们的帮助。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Jerome-7622": "JEROME: 首都贴着那么多求助的告示。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Jerome-7623": "JEROME: 那些人正急需援手，我实在不忍就这样置之不理。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Agata-7624": "AGATA: 狄奥提玛说，她的……我们的哥哥……去了北边寻找基娜拉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Agata-7625": "AGATA: 得护送乔尔乔斯登上山顶。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Agata-7626": "AGATA: 得找个了解蛮族的人，辨认这些珠饰。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Agata-7627": "AGATA: 他们说，每年这个时候，阿斯库扎雅人都会在东边的半岛扎营。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Agata-7628": "AGATA: 我的兄长们……另外那几位……说只要和他们切磋，就把遗产交给我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Agata-7629": "AGATA: 不知道狄奥提玛听了这些，会怎么想？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Agata-7630": "AGATA: 这些事我压根没料到，抱歉让大家陪我折腾了这么一趟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-ch11Agata-7631": "AGATA: 等回阿科斯，我还得向守护者团复命。到时候……可有得聊了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-auslenBombDialogue-7632": "NIKOLAI: 那是奥斯伦的首都，他们可不欢迎我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/chapter11scenes.yarn-luskiyanBombDialogue-7633": "NIKOLAI: 卢斯基亚人不愿搭理我们，倒也不奇怪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3452": "Title: 朱娜的族群",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3453": "Description: 在本的世界，前往东北荒野寻找朱娜的族群。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3454": "Title: 蜿蜒长路",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3455": "Description: 沿着曲折的小径穿过东北荒野。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-dragonKid-8479": "DRAGON KID: 别忘了善待别人！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-dragonKid-8480": "DRAGON KID: 大家都在这个世界上努力生活，友善一点总没坏处，何况我们未必知道别人正经历什么！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-rawlos-8481": "RA'WLOS: 来听听智者拉沃洛斯的智慧！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-rawlos-8482": "RA'WLOS: 钟表为什么总喊饿？因为它一天到晚都惦记着饭点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-rawlos-8483": "RA'WLOS: 千万别讨论画鸡蛋的哲学，不然会陷入“蛋生危机”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-rawlos-8484": "RA'WLOS: 砍木头的人为什么早早收工？因为他已经“木”聊透了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-rawlos-8485": "RA'WLOS: 夸人就该把人夸成高原，那才叫高度赞扬。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-rawlos-8486": "RA'WLOS: 熬夜熬得背疼？那是你的背在说，这个夜我可“背”不动了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-rawlos-8487": "RA'WLOS: 弓箭手从不错过机会，因为他们懂得“箭”机行事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-rawlos-8488": "RA'WLOS: 我的智慧怎么样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-rawlos-8489": "挺好笑的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-rawlos-8490": "RA'WLOS: 嘿嘿，谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-rawlos-8491": "呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-rawlos-8492": "RA'WLOS: 好吧，我自找的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-wizard-8493": "WIZARD: 当心那些急着帮你解决问题的人，他们往往另有所图。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-flowerGirl-8494": "FLOWER GIRL: 想买些花或香草吗？要不试试炸鸡花束？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-scythe-8495": "SCYTHE: 我显然就是最终头目……不过想想看，你听过哪个瘾君子说，今天不碰了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-scythe-8496": "SCYTHE: 那当然！今天可别连个瘾君子都比你拼，宝贝儿，活出自己的样子来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-asian-8497": "LI: 我？我是学生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-asian-8498": "LI: 机器回收、维修这些实际门道，佩罗先生可比理工大学的老师懂得多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-riki-8499": "RIKI: 你好啊！好宝贝全归我！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-mercenary-8500": "MERCENARY: 你们拿的什么？刀？法杖？厨房用具？不行，这可不行。不如试试弓？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-baldHorns-8501": "MAN: 要么夺下王座，要么自己造一个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-skullFire-8502": "SKULL FIRE: 为什么我的脑袋着火？别问，不告诉你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-skullFire-8503": "SKULL FIRE: 反正别碰那些花里胡哨、还点着火的鸡尾酒，也别往风大的地方去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-adanna-8504": "ADANNA: 你好！我叫阿丹娜·阿韦纳尔，从阿尔班来这儿度假。不得不说，来这儿可真像在冒险呢！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-prophet-8505": "PROPHET: 未来的战场上，用的会是过去的武器。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-pointyEars-8506": "MAN: 我正肩负击败绿龙的崇高使命。你见过奎因吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-coyote-8507": "CRAFTY COYOTE: 和蛮族部落讲和以后，我才见识到这个世界藏着多少秘密。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-madruga-8508": "MADRUGA: 工作哪有不好的？不好的是非得工作！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-catNPC-8509": "CAT: 咪呜！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-oscar-8510": "SHOP KEEPER: 只有遇上马上要命的危险，才有必要跑，别的事慢慢来就行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-beer-8511": "MAN: 嘿，喝杯啤酒吗？我这啤酒可是全国最好的，世界各地的人都特意来尝呢！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-tina-8512": "WOMAN: 毛衣针也能很危险！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-samus-8513": "WOMAN: 还没遇到过我杀不了的怪物，以后也不会有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-sebastian-8514": "MAN: 我可不是一般的英俊天才，还强悍得很，一记抱摔就能把火车摔翻！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-peter-8515": "PETER: 我把多盖尔的《伊纳民族学》借给俱乐部，他们转眼就弄丢了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-peter-8516": "PETER: 应该还在楼里，只是放错位置了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-sage-8517": "SCHOLAR: 嗯……这是哪儿？看来我来到另一所魔法学院了，和我那所完全不同。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-sage-8518": "SCHOLAR: 走之前，或许可以四处看看……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-blackCat-8519": "BLACK CAT: 我用错了魔法，结果……变成了猫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-tealVest-8520": "MAN: 都说暴力解决不了一切，可只要你够擅长，暴力什么都能解决！经验值攒得怎么样了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-bossCat-8521": "WOMAN: 哟！祝各位旅途顺利。听说前头有些经典的东西等着你们……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-jester-8522": "JESTER: 想玩牌吗？当心我的陷阱……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-laine-8523": "LAINE: 啊，你好！你见过我的宠物蛇克莱门汀吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-laine-8524": "LAINE: 我看书时睡着了，醒来才发现她不见了。她肯定还在这附近，克莱门汀最喜欢到处探险了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-laineSnake-8525": "CLEMENTINE: ……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-elliana-8526": "GIRL: 我叫艾莉安娜，这是我妹妹布里姬特，我们正在练本事，以后要当冒险家！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-elliana-8527": "GIRL: 喜欢我们的盔甲吗？这可是我们自己做的！爸爸还在帮我们画藏宝图，好让我们练练本事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-bridget-8528": "GIRL: 我叫艾莉安娜，这是我妹妹布里姬特，我们正在练本事，以后要当冒险家！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-bridget-8529": "GIRL: 喜欢我们的盔甲吗？这可是我们自己做的！爸爸还在帮我们画藏宝图，好让我们练练本事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-francenso-8530": "MAN: 今晚我要做李子洋葱派！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-francenso-8531": "MAN: 昨晚我给妈妈做了大蒜梨子汤，她没喝……不过这汤本来就是第二天更好喝嘛。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-lex-8532": "LEXCANIUM: 你好！我正在四处旅行，帮助有需要的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-lex-8533": "LEXCANIUM: 我还是继续赶路吧，这里用不着我帮忙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerNPCs.yarn-jubilee-8534": "JUBILEE: 我正设法还债，要买点东西吗？"
}
